# Production Neon branch — copy to `tooling/seeding/.env.production` (gitignored).
# Used by `bun run db:migrate:production` (Hyperdrive origin DB; school + auth schema).
# Secrets belong in Wrangler (`wrangler secret bulk secrets.prod.json --env production`), not here.

# Neon production branch connection string — must match the Hyperdrive origin in wrangler.jsonc.
# PRODUCTION_DATABASE_URL=postgres://…
